The scheme $S'$ is sometimes called the <em>universal flatificator</em>. In <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/GruRay">GruRay</a>]</span> it is called the <em>platificateur universel</em>. Existence of the universal flattening should not be confused with the type of results discussed in More on Algebra, Section <a href="/tag/0535" data-tag="0535">15.27</a>.